段参考所列文档。PokéAPI提供宝可梦、物种、招式和其他结构化资源。本地参考快照保留来源URL、抓取时间和摘要，缓存可以复用，但它不是官方赛事规则公告。不能根据物种存在或图鉴有数据，就判断其能参加当前排位。朱紫招式列表按接口中scarlet-violet的版本组过滤；这不能代替特定补丁、赛事或配招组合的完整合法性检查。回答当前强势阵容时需要有日期和赛制相符的使用率、赛事等证据；没有这些证据，应明确限制。","contentHash":"sha256:646ecf409f2ddb19c067dd0978eb3aecf62924e395a81f58848a83780baaa163"}},{"document":{"id":"ability-item-traceability-v1","title":"特性与道具先查询，再核对计算回读","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"特性 道具 ability item 查询 资源 机制 回读 标识","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","content":"项目可通过lookupPokemonResource查询ability与item资源，也可查询move和nature。资料接口返回的是允许字段中的可用内容，并附来源和本地参考身份。没有返回某项机制说明时，应明确资料不足，不要仅凭名字猜测其效果。成员特性候选与当前保存特性也需分开：候选只说明资料列出这个名称，不代表用户已经选择它。\n\n本地计算桥接会验证非空的特性与道具名称，无法识别时拒绝计算。计算完成后应核对assumptions中实际使用的名称；缺省或未填写的配置不能被解读为某个道具已生效。队伍存储只验证名称输入边界，不提供特性、道具和物种的完整搭配合法性审查。推荐某个组合之前，还需要规则与机制支持，不能由保存成功推出组合合法或最优。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"PokéAPI v2资源字段文档","publisher":"PokéAPI","url":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"API_FIELD_REFERENCE"},{"title":"Smogon damage-calc项目接口说明","publisher":"Smogon damage-calc contributors","url":"https://github.com/smogon/damage-calc","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"ENGINE_INTERFACE_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/reference/LocalPokeApiRepository.java","sha256":"fd086f665294efba73948c47d216865d3cdf35bc42cd311c2a1648e2c8842475"},{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/domain/TeamBuild.java","sha256":"03e80f52f6a583f8c00d5e60febc16763f9d2983d57462b2235c5237219d36e2"},{"path":"tools/pokemon-engine/calculate.cjs","sha256":"90e080660f1f4f65062358728d8448143a16e82adc148bcabc014af4512f3358"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["resource"]}},"score":4665,"checksum":"sha256:3c8d70531f85fa933fbb2b3e7d0c7c1308e3c422aa1907e8ad1ab5bd9435946c","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-d27e56e88f9d1e9ab37edbd12e15e843217300573b42006cf0daa47b4be5bca9","documentVersion":"sha256:95ee64bb91153af9b31cbe76fabcdaaf3523bc072996a7b2314c082ba77ad2a8","chunkNo":1,"startOffset":167,"endOffset":321,"text":"本地计算桥接会验证非空的特性与道具名称，无法识别时拒绝计算。计算完成后应核对assumptions中实际使用的名称；缺省或未填写的配置不能被解读为某个道具已生效。队伍存储只验证名称输入边界，不提供特性、道具和物种的完整搭配合法性审查。推荐某个组合之前，还需要规则与机制支持，不能由保存成功推出组合合法或最优。","contentHash":"sha256:453e4b71c393435ff20cf137a081385ccd7d886c51785d1d987cbc3bca87f847"}},{"document":{"id":"training-configuration-v1","title":"培养配置：性格、努力值与个体值","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"培养 养成 努力值 个体值 EV IV 性格 nature 配招","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-20","sourceUrl":"","content":"这是项目原创的配置填写说明。保存配置前先明确输出方式和目标对手，再选择性格、等级、个体值和努力值。项目验证努力值单项不超过252、总和不超过510，个体值为0到31。不能仅凭这些边界就断言某种配置最优。性格、特性、道具和招式需要配合；低攻击个体值或低速度个体值属于特定战术条件，不应未经询问自动代入。初次分析应列出哪些是用户提供的条件、哪些是工具的默认条件，并询问未明确的赛制或配置。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/domain/TeamBuild.java","sha256":"03e80f52f6a583f8c00d5e60febc16763f9d2983d57462b2235c5237219d36e2"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["training"]}},"score":3730,"checksum":"sha256:a6843fc6e7d5f43c6848e242100da56e4307120714137de5e5910a833ca94592","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-2f54ab8c5292c79772e3495dee4bf48203109c70bbd8f7efbaf0413a32be9822","documentVersion":"sha256:990b0841d1b782a77aa9e0f5b698b403e7bdb83bfdec5f32cbe8e5e8b26a8274","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":192,"text":"这是项目原创的配置填写说明。保存配置前先明确输出方式和目标对手，再选择性格、等级、个体值和努力值。项目验证努力值单项不超过252、总和不超过510，个体值为0到31。不能仅凭这些边界就断言某种配置最优。性格、特性、道具和招式需要配合；低攻击个体值或低速度个体值属于特定战术条件，不应未经询问自动代入。初次分析应列出哪些是用户提供的条件、哪些是工具的默认条件，并询问未明确的赛制或配置。","contentHash":"sha256:0c23ddc8dd348678b83298b34307cf0a932fe926b7c0c05e0be04978ee48fade"}},{"document":{"id":"move-version-and-identifiers-v1","title":"朱紫招式候选与英文标识","gameReleaseId":"pokemon-scarlet-violet","keywords":"招式 候选 版本 学习 英文 名称 slug moves 配招","author":"VIO project","updatedAt":"2026-10-23","sourceUrl":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","content":"本项目把招式查询与招式选择分开。成员资料中的候选招式按PokéAPI的版本组记录筛选，只收集scarlet-violet对应条目；这一步用于限定参考范围，不能等同于特定补丁、赛事或招式组合的合法性审核。候选列表为空时，只能说明当前参考数据没有取得相应候选，不能断言这只宝可梦没有招式。\n\n填写和计算时优先使用工具实际返回的英文名称或slug，不要由中文名称猜造标识。可再用lookupPokemonResource读取move资源，核对其返回字段。队伍配置最多保存四个不重复招式；保存成功只代表输入满足项目边界。决定配招前还需明确成员角色、目标对局和规则，缺少机制或学习途径证据时先说明不足，而不是从名称推测威力或效果。","language":"zh-CN","battleFormatId":"casual-singles","rulesetVersionId":"casual-v1","validUntil":null,"provenance":{"kind":"PROJECT_NOTE","contentUsage":"ORIGINAL_NO_UPSTREAM_COPY","acquiredAt":"2026-10-23","reviewStatus":"PENDING_HUMAN_REVIEW","references":[{"title":"PokéAPI v2资源字段文档","publisher":"PokéAPI","url":"https://pokeapi.co/docs/v2","checkedAt":"2026-10-23","relation":"API_FIELD_REFERENCE"}],"codeReferences":[{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/reference/LocalPokeApiRepository.java","sha256":"fd086f665294efba73948c47d216865d3cdf35bc42cd311c2a1648e2c8842475"},{"path":"src/main/java/com/vio/vioaiagent/pokemon/domain/TeamBuild.java","sha256":"03e80f52f6a583f8c00d5e60febc16763f9d2983d57462b2235c5237219d36e2"}]},"applicability":{"subjects":[],"topics":["resource"]}},"score":2985,"checksum":"sha256:5cab5c1bc4a68580ac7433747f28ee6d36fabd9b39b1d95156f78ef09820a949","citation":{"chunkId":"guide-0c05e2d871cc91a0c205a23a3b1cec9181f0c5809a8c0e485a50f9ec51190119","documentVersion":"sha256:350b8c4603e2cb087d61f8fc7dd1ce9afb98a2980112eae389917e7befdaabda","chunkNo":0,"startOffset":0,"endOffset":142,"text":"本项目把招式查询与招式选择分开。成员资料中的候选招式按PokéAPI的版本组记录筛选，只收集scarlet-violet对应条目；这一步用于限定参考范围，不能等同于特定补丁、赛事或招式组合的合法性审核。候选列表为空时，只能说明当前参考数据没有取得相应候选，不能断言这只宝可梦没有招式。","contentHash":"sha256:44dfcdd6ba719c75aec452d4da7b5d13256e31bb197920db0ca313687392273b"}}]]], messageType=TOOL, metadata={messageType=TOOL}}, UserMessage{content='Based on user needs, proactively select the most appropriate tool or combination of tools.
For complex tasks, you can break down the problem and use different tools step by step to solve it.
After using each tool, clearly explain the execution results and suggest the next steps.

Guidelines:
1. If the user's request is simple and you can answer directly, just respond without using tools.
2. For multi-step tasks, plan the sequence before acting — search first, then analyze, then generate.
3. After each tool execution, review the result. If something went wrong, try an alternative approach.
4. When a task requires information from multiple sources, gather all data before synthesizing.
5. Once you have enough evidence, respond with the final answer directly, without any tool call.
   A direct answer ends the task automatically. Do not spend another turn calling doTerminate.
   If evidence is unavailable, explain the limitation and answer only what can be supported.

Remember: You are in control. Drive the task forward step by step until it is done.
', properties={messageType=USER}, messageType=USER}], modelOptions=org.springframework.ai.model.tool.DefaultToolCallingChatOptions@6034448b}
